INSTALLATION:

 Take the files donations,pledged, and received and copy them to your Pfiles
directory. Then, either keep it in pfiles by adding it there. OR
if you'd rather it somewhere else use the line \#0Pfiles:donations\ where you 
would like it..

NOTE:

Just make sure to go into the files pledged and donations and erase the names
that are in there now, and go into the file Donations and change the mailing
address and paths as needed.

If you would like to receive any updates to this, past pfiles of mine, or
any future works, send a donation of (anything over a dollar) or more and
the name of your BBS and I will upload them to you as they are requested.
Also, when donations are received your bbsname will appear on my list of 
other bbs'.

